1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
A dime from me never paid back.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:09,440
I had this grudge, I forgive you, you don't need to pay me back.

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:16,240
Or a few years ago you took my husband, I need his psychiatric care, he really tore

4
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:22,080
me up, but God has forgiven me, I forgive you.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:30,560
Fifteen years ago, I hurt you, I've called to apologize.

6
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:34,800
A lot of clean churches, you just need to lift the rug.

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,880
You know what's under there?

8
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,040
Just lift the rug.

9
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,400
We want to sweep under the rug.

10
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:46,080
When one is too many.

11
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:52,160
Tonight, I want you to recommit your life to Christ.

12
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:54,240
One hundred percent.

13
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,920
You may ask, how do I do that?

14
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,160
Say it.

15
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,920
Say, Father.

